{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/manazel-al-khor-meraas-al-jaddaf-waterfront","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":572,"crm_id":"1558","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Manazel Al Khor","slug":"manazel-al-khor-meraas-al-jaddaf-waterfront","display_address":"Al Jaddaf","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2018","developer":"Meraas","price":1355000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.2297793,"longitude":55.3372695,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Manazel Al Khor is a modern Arabian-style residential and commercial complex in the heart of Culture Village in Dubai, located in Al Jaddaf Waterfront Jumeirah.</p><p>The development consists of 98 residential units including <strong>1-4 bedroom apartments</strong>. All units are equipped with panoramic windows overlooking the Dubai Creek coastline. The interior decoration is made taking into account the main trends in the field of design. The floors in the common areas are made of natural marble, in the bedrooms - laid parquet, and in the bathrooms - mosaic and porcelain tiles.</p><p>Manazel Al Khor has everything you need for a comfortable stay: gym, fitness center, swimming pool, private parking, children's playground, public parks, barbecue areas.</p><p>Manazel Al Khor is surrounded by green landscaped areas and is under 24-hour security.</p><p>There are many stores, restaurants and cafes within walking distance from Manazel Al Khor. The complex has excellent transportation accessibility. It is close to Al Jadaf metro station on the green line and 5 minutes from Dubai International Airport.</p><p>The favorable location of the project allows you to quickly get to the famous attractions of the emirate, Dubai Mall - just 15 minutes, to The Walk JBR - 30 minutes.</p><p>A marina is located right next to the complex. Culture Village has many galleries, museums, libraries, art schools and theaters, as well as conservatories, art and dance academies.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1558/images/2024/04/10/ZNj3J9xzXUIHdrmdKWbTxAqHehLcYw5u3YWamkEw.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/10/ZNj3J9xzXUIHdrmdKWbTxAqHehLcYw5u3YWamkEw.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1558/images/2024/04/10/LHD4UGPesINKPnaS2YzwCbO8FehCbAQEQwkrrV5s.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/10/LHD4UGPesINKPnaS2YzwCbO8FehCbAQEQwkrrV5s.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1558/images/2024/04/10/Sqz7DP4IGMbME3pqnC62bMBZhaMGKZPY25KUAO0B.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/10/Sqz7DP4IGMbME3pqnC62bMBZhaMGKZPY25KUAO0B.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2850,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/04/01/WV9L5xPu3HotC3sQEqoc88X5UmWmEHvvLrUJ8dJx.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1100,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":5569,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":5570,"title":"80%","description":"2 Months from Booking Date"}],"community":"Al Jaddaf","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":9038,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9039,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9040,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9041,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9042,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9043,"url":null,"text":"Leisure areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9044,"url":null,"text":"Dining outlets  (coffee houses & r